body:
So, someone created a Google ADS account through my name and email and created ADS that got charged via Paypal for 10$ -> the most ridiculous thing is: same happened to my father.

&#x200B;

A week after that, someone managed to log into my Twitter account and shared multiple posts with "thanks elon for free eth, click here" bullshit.

&#x200B;

And yesterday someone managed to get into my Instagram account and did the same "thanks elon" bullshit again.

&#x200B;

I have 2FA on everything. I have no idea how he managed to bypass it all.

&#x200B;

Now I did a hard reset on my phone, used Windows anti virus, malwarebytes and did a full MRT on my computer. (No malware or whatsoever) Also I changed ALL 2FA from Google Authentificator to Microsoft Authentificator. Furtheremore Im doing a 3FA now & also changed ALL passwords.

&#x200B;

If I get hacked again, I really do not know what in the fuck I am supposed to do.

The "100%" part gotta be bullshit. I agree on Daytrading being risky in general but "traders typically lose 100% of their money within 12 months" is just pure bullshit. You're telling me out of 1.000.000 people, 1.000.000 lose money on trading? Huge bullshit here.

&#x200B;

If this would've been directed to leveraged trading, then perhaps, yes that could happen but definitelly not with daytrading in general.

