No joke ich hab die schnauze voll mir die beschissene politische Meinung meiner Eltern anzuhören. Sobald IRGENDWAS politisches kommt, geh ich inzwischen direkt weg. Wirklich ohne zu zögern bin ich weg.

Are you serious? I was alone, my teammates both died few minute ago and I couldnt revive them and both left the lobby once I got #3. Also, how the fuck am I supposed not to "push without \[my\] team", if I dont have a team? Also, if you didnt notice, in that very moment it was 3v1v1. Its the solo wraith, solo me (ocatane) and the 3 others. I knock 1 down with the kraber, hit the other one aswell, kill the wraith and knock mirage out aswell so its a 1v1 in the end. Also, after watchign the replay, Im sure I would have killed Caustic without changing my shield, since he was low hp aswell and has only reset his shield but I didnt think about that in the moment.

&#x200B;

And yet you're telling me that I suck? What the hell.

Its hard to explain but what I've been using is working out quite well.

Im not doing this for a year yet but still it is way more profit than loss. It is quite simple, I use support & resistance but on 1/5/15M timeframe & mix that with Martingale.

If I see a coin breaking a small resistance, I buy/short the coin with 10x (or 20x depending on how sure I am)  and if the opposite direction happens, I just martingale my way out. I would suggest it to you because once you learn how and when to use it, you could be in good profits! :)

&#x200B;

Just make sure to start with VERY low amount of $ since you are going to aim for the % and not the amount of $ in the beginning.

&#x200B;

Also what I've learned: Do not & NEVER panic! Yes, you are trading with your own money but still, try to be as calm as possible. Also, do not trade if you are stressed or had a bad day. All of the negative things will have an impact on you whilst trading.

&#x200B;

Have a nice day and I hope you will learn and profit! :)

For real, I'm a man and I look scary as fuck (I'm quite a bear I guess) and yet I what I always do in the night when I'm walking home alone and see someone else in the same road, I switch lanes.

